    "sections": [
      {
        "h2": "What Are the Essential Morning Skincare Steps?",
        "content": "<p>The essential morning skincare routine focuses on antioxidant protection and ultraviolet defense through four sequential steps:</p>\n          <ol>\n            <li><strong>Step 1: Gentle Cleansing:</strong> Wash face with a mild gel or foaming cleanser to remove nocturnal sweat and sebum without stripping natural lipids.</li>\n            <li><strong>Step 2: Hydrating Toner:</strong> Pat an alcohol-free toner into skin to balance post-wash pH and saturate the stratum corneum with moisture.</li>\n            <li><strong>Step 3: Lightweight Moisturizer:</strong> Apply an oil-free gel or light lotion to lock in hydration and smooth the skin's surface.</li>\n            <li><strong>Step 4: Broad-Spectrum Sunscreen:</strong> Apply two finger-lengths of SPF 50+ sunscreen as the non-negotiable final step to shield cells from UVA and UVB rays.</li>\n          </ol>"
      },
      {
        "h2": "What Are the Recommended Evening Skincare Steps for Skin Repair?",
        "content": "<p>The evening skincare routine prioritizes thorough double-cleansing and cellular barrier repair while the body rests overnight:</p>\n          <ol>\n            <li><strong>Step 1: Oil-Based Makeup Removal:</strong> Dissolve waterproof cosmetics, excess sebum, and sunscreen with micellar water or a cleansing balm.</li>\n            <li><strong>Step 2: Water-Based Cleanser:</strong> Wash with a foaming face wash to cleanse away residual impurities from the pores.</li>\n            <li><strong>Step 3: Active Treatment Serum:</strong> Apply targeted serums such as Niacinamide, Retinol, or Hyaluronic acid directly onto clean, towel-dried skin.</li>\n            <li><strong>Step 4: Nourishing Night Cream:</strong> Seal the skin with a ceramide-rich barrier cream to prevent nocturnal moisture evaporation.</li>\n          </ol>"
      },
      {
        "h2": "Where Can Shoppers Source Genuine Skincare Products in Itahari?",
        "content": "<p>Following a consistent morning and evening skincare regimen requires verified, skin-safe formulations that maintain active ingredient potency without harmful counterfeit adulterants.</p>\n          <p>For everyday personal shoppers and beauty salon practitioners across Sunsari, our physical showroom stocks authenticated items under our comprehensive <a href=\"/cosmetics/skincare/\">Skincare Products in Itahari, Nepal</a> catalog at an immediate 5% discount on MRP, with wholesale carton options available for regional stores.</p>"
      }
    ],
    "faqs": [
      {
        "q": "How long should I wait between applying serum and moisturizer?",
        "a": "Wait approximately 60 seconds for active serums to absorb into the skin before applying your moisturizing cream."
      },
      {
        "q": "Is sunscreen really necessary if I stay indoors in Itahari?",
        "a": "Yes, UVA rays penetrate window glass and reflect off concrete surfaces, causing gradual hyperpigmentation even during indoor daytime activities."
      }
    ]
